{"seq":4,"slug":"philosophy-of-science","title":"科学技术哲学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"科学技术哲学\">科学技术哲学</h1><p>我真正开始对这门学科产生兴趣，是在一次和朋友争论&quot;中医算不算科学&quot;的饭桌上。我们俩谁也说服不了谁，因为我们其实没有搞清楚一个更根本的问题：到底什么样的东西才配叫&quot;科学&quot;？那一刻我意识到，&quot;科学&quot;这个我每天挂在嘴边的词，自己竟然从来没有认真定义过。科学技术哲学，恰恰就是一门专门拷问这些&quot;想当然&quot;问题的学科。</p>\n<p>它不教你具体的物理公式或者编程技巧，而是退后一步，去追问那些藏在科学和技术背后的根本假设：科学知识是怎么被证明为&quot;真&quot;的？为什么牛顿力学曾经被奉为绝对真理，后来又被相对论&quot;推翻&quot;，但我们造桥盖楼时还在用它？技术仅仅是中立的工具，还是它本身就在悄悄塑造我们的思维方式和社会结构？当人工智能开始替我们做决策时，谁该为出错负责？</p>\n<p>这门学科大致沿着四条线索展开。第一条是<strong>科学方法论与划界问题</strong>：科学和伪科学的边界到底在哪里，归纳、演绎、可证伪性这些工具各自能走多远。第二条是<strong>科学革命与范式转换</strong>：以库恩、拉卡托斯、费耶阿本德为代表，他们告诉我们科学的进步并非一条笔直向上的直线，而是充满了断裂、竞争甚至非理性。第三条是<strong>技术哲学</strong>：把目光从&quot;科学是什么&quot;转向&quot;技术是什么&quot;，讨论技术是否有它自己的发展逻辑，以及面对基因编辑、生成式 AI 这类新技术时我们该如何抉择。第四条是<strong>科学技术与社会（STS）</strong>：科学不是在真空里发生的，它嵌在实验室、资助机构、舆论和政治当中，公众为什么信任或不信任科学，是 2026 年绕不开的现实议题。</p>\n<p>我写这套笔记的方式，是把自己当成一个边学边想的同路人，而不是站在讲台上的教授。每一节都会先抛出一个我自己曾经困惑的问题，再带着你一步步把它想清楚。读完之后，你未必能背出每一位哲学家的生卒年，但下次再有人在饭桌上跟你争&quot;什么算科学&quot;，你至少能问出几个更聪明的问题。</p>\n<p>建议的阅读顺序就按章节编号来：先打好方法论的地基，再进入科学史的动态视角，然后转向技术，最后落到技术与社会的交叉地带。如果你时间紧张，第一章和第二章是整套内容的核心骨架，值得反复咀嚼。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-method-and-demarcation","title":"科学方法论与划界问题","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/scientific-method-and-demarcation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"induction-and-deduction","title":"归纳与演绎：科学推理的两台引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/scientific-method-and-demarcation/induction-and-deduction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"falsifiability-and-demarcation","title":"可证伪性与划界：波普尔的分界线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/scientific-method-and-demarcation/falsifiability-and-demarcation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"theory-and-observation","title":"理论与观察：被理论\"渗透\"的眼睛","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/scientific-method-and-demarcation/theory-and-observation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"scientific-revolutions-and-paradigms","title":"科学革命与范式转换","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/scientific-revolutions-and-paradigms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kuhn-paradigm-and-revolution","title":"库恩：范式与科学革命的结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/scientific-revolutions-and-paradigms/kuhn-paradigm-and-revolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lakatos-research-programmes","title":"拉卡托斯：研究纲领与进步的标准","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/scientific-revolutions-and-paradigms/lakatos-research-programmes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feyerabend-and-scientific-realism","title":"费耶阿本德与科学实在论：方法的尽头与真实的追问","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/scientific-revolutions-and-paradigms/feyerabend-and-scientific-realism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"philosophy-of-technology","title":"技术哲学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/philosophy-of-technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-technology","title":"技术是什么：从工具到\"座架\"","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/philosophy-of-technology/what-is-technology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"technological-determinism-and-autonomy","title":"技术决定论与自主性：是我们在用技术，还是技术在用我们","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/philosophy-of-technology/technological-determinism-and-autonomy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ethics-of-emerging-technology","title":"新兴技术的伦理：当机器开始替我们决定","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/philosophy-of-technology/ethics-of-emerging-technology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"science-technology-and-society","title":"科学技术与社会（STS）","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/science-technology-and-society","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-construction-of-technology","title":"技术的社会建构（SCOT）：自行车为什么长成现在这样","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/science-technology-and-society/social-construction-of-technology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"science-policy-and-public-trust","title":"科学政策与公众信任：我们凭什么相信科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/philosophy/philosophy-of-science/science-technology-and-society/science-policy-and-public-trust"}]}]}